UNIVERSITY ACT, 1997
CHAPTER III OFFICERS OF THE UNIVERSITY
8. Officers of the University‑‑ The following
shall be the officers of the University:
(a) the Chancellor;
(b,) the Vice‑Chancellor;
(c) the Deans;
(d) the Directors;
(e) the Chairmen of Academic
Departments;
(t) the Registrar
(g) the Treasurer;
(h) the Controller of Examination;
(i) the Librarian; and
(j) such other persons as may be declared to be
officers of the University.

Authorities  of the university

